        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ঠান্ডা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঠান্ডা — ṭhānḍā — \"cold; chilly; cold weather\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঠান্ডা জলে স্নান করে অরুণ কাঁপছিল। ṭhānḍā jôle snān kore ôrun kā̃pchhilô. After bathing in cold water Arun was shivering."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a cold you catch: ঠান্ডা (ṭhānḍā) লাগা. শীত is the cold season and the cold you feel; ঠান্ডা (ṭhānḍā) is cold things too."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঠান্ডা (ṭhānḍā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Bengali ṭhāṇḍā, \"cold\", under Sanskrit stabdha, \"stiffened, numb\" (CDIAL 13676): cold is what makes you stiff."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
