              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জমে যাওয়া — jôme jāoyā — \"to freeze; to set hard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পাহাড়ে রাতে কলের জল জমে গেল। pāhāṛe rāte kôler jôl jôme gelô. In the hills the water in the tap froze overnight."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he/she …): সেই জল জমে গেল, sei jôl jôme gelô."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of a crowd or a party: আড্ডা জমে গেল, the chat got going."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
