              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জমে যাওয়া (jôme jāoyā) joins the -এ form of জমা, which CDIAL lists as Bengali jamā, \"to collect, to coagulate, to freeze\", under Sanskrit yamyátē (CDIAL 10428), to যাওয়া, to go: to go hard."
            }
